vate AI. Local compute.</span></div><div class=\"product-page-intro\"><p class=\"lead\">Room for<br>what comes next.</p><p>Four Ateliers in a mobile rack, with eight to sixteen GPUs across serviceable modules.</p></div><div class=\"product-page-stage\"><h1 id=\"product-page-title\">Atelier<br>Rack.</h1><img src=\"/assets/atelier-rack-unibody-v8-1254.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/atelier-rack-unibody-v8-768.webp 768w,/assets/atelier-rack-unibody-v8-1254.webp 1254w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 55vw\" width=\"1254\" height=\"1254\" alt=\"Four Kiln Ateliers in a seamless satin aluminium rack with curved upper corners and precision disc casters\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></div><div class=\"product-page-bottom\"><div><p class=\"product-price\">Configured to order.</p></div><button class=\"action primary enquiry-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln Atelier Rack\">Request a quote <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"kilnos\" aria-labelledby=\"kilnos-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">Planning your installation</span><span class=\"meta\">In development</span></div><div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"kilnos-title\">Plan for<br>the whole studio.</h2><p>A proposed compute system for several teams, configured around the models they use and the work they run.</p></div><div class=\"local-grid\"><article><span class=\"meta\">01 / Workload</span><h3>Start with<br>the work.</h3><p>Scope the model mix, job sizes and expected demand with us.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">02 / Installation</span><h3>Fit the<br>space.</h3><p>Plan power, networking and access for servicing before installation.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">03 / Operations</span><h3>Keep it<br>manageable.</h3><p>Define updates, support and responsibilities for the team running the system.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"rack-growth-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2 id=\"rack-growth-title\">Upgrade by module.</h2></div><p class=\"lead\">Add capacity where you need it.</p><p>Start with two GPUs in each of the four Ateliers. Upgrade individual modules to four GPUs as demand grows. Your quote covers the modules, rack infrastructure and installation; managed software is separate.</p></section><section class=\"section local software-pricing\" id=\"software-pricing\" aria-labelledby=\"software-pricing-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">Managed KilnOS</span><span class=\"meta\">Proposed software plan</span></div><div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"software-pricing-title\">£79 per creator.<br>Per month.</h2><p>120-creator minimum. <strong>£113,760 per year minimum</strong>, billed annually, ex VAT. Shared projects, approvals, qualified updates and standard support.</p></div><p class=\"service-boundary\">Review-only seats are free. Creation and agent actions require a paid creator seat. Hardware, cloud usage, custom integrations and enhanced service levels are additional. Licensed seat counts do not guarantee simultaneous workload capacity.</p><p class=\"fine\">GPU upgrades leave your per-creator rate unchanged. Additional creator seats use the same rate.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-link enquiry-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln Atelier Rack\">Discuss this plan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></section><section class=\"section specifications\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>At a glance.</h2><span class=\"meta\">Proposed specifications</span></div><dl class=\"spec-grid\"><div><dt>Architecture target</dt><dd>Four Kiln Ateliers</dd></div><div><dt>Enclosure</dt><dd>Modular rack on wheels</dd></div><div><dt>Compute configuration</dt><dd>Defined with your team</dd></div><div><dt>Operating system</dt><dd>KilnOS / In development</dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"section reservation\" id=\"interest\"><div class=\"reservation-heading\"><span class=\"meta\">Kiln Atelier Rack</span><h2>Let’s size<br